{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blanky is a 2D platformer that combines fluid movement with fast thinking to avoid environmental hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/5a8ae6c4da1cf644b8ae679b5dd947f3.poster.avif?t=1758009669\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/5a8ae6c4da1cf644b8ae679b5dd947f3.webm?t=1758009669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/5a8ae6c4da1cf644b8ae679b5dd947f3.mp4?t=1758009669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using multiple abilities discovered along the way, Jacob travels through nightmarish areas each with their own distinct dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/e12640f1908a3aeceba040bf9065c111.poster.avif?t=1758009669\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/e12640f1908a3aeceba040bf9065c111.webm?t=1758009669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870300/extras/e12640f1908a3aeceba040bf9065c111.mp4?t=1758009669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring epic boss battles, heart pounding chases and a compelling story, Blanky is a challenging platforming adventure that explores fear from a child's point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Every Hero Needs Their Cape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco